 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? They usually earn that fee for planning one, often with weddings they planned for friends and family at no charge. Then a planner can really help, especially if you want something other than standard wedding agenda. Most weddings these days squeeze everything in one day, with the ceremony and reception back to back. Some have small reception the day after, for guests to fly in. It is, with all the activities packed in. Many people do, and full wedding weekend means some guests miss out if their travel is limited. A planner can help with that, helping everyone say yes without anyone feeling shortchanged.",
